{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Playground logging can generate, at a minimum, a structured description"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of any type. If you want to provide a custom description of your type to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"logged in place of the default description, conform to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Playground logging generates a richer, more specialized description of core"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"types. For example, the contents of a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" are logged, as are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components of an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSColor"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIColor"},{"type":"text","text":". The current playground logging"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"implementation logs specialized descriptions of at least the following","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"types:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSString"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"UInt","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and the other standard library integer types"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Float","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Date","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSDate","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSAttributedString","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSRange"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSURL","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"CGPoint","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"CGSize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"CGRect","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSColor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIColor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"CGColor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"CIColor","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSImage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIImage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"CGImage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CIImage"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSBezierPath","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIBezierPath","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSView"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIView","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Playground logging may also be able to support specialized descriptions","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of other types.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Conforming to the CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible Protocol","anchor":"Conforming-to-the-CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible-Protocol","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To add "},{"code":"CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformance to your custom type,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implement the ","type":"text"},{"code":"playgroundDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property. If your implementation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns an instance of one of the types above, that type’s specialized","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description is used. If you return any other type, a structured description"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is generated."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your type has value semantics, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"playgroundDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unaffected by subsequent mutations, if possible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your type’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"playgroundDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" returns an instance which itself"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible"},{"type":"text","text":", then that type’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"playgroundDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" will be used, and so on. To prevent infinite loops,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"playground logging implementations can place a reasonable limit on this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"t